{"id":"bdf31dc44330a10b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/624_分支时态模态逻辑.md","title":"624 分支时态模态逻辑","display":"624_分支时态模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{AX},\\quad \\operatorname{EX},\\quad \\operatorname{AG},\\quad \\operatorname{EG}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{AX},\\quad \\operatorname{EX},\\quad \\operatorname{AG},\\quad \\operatorname{EG}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号直接写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AXA,EXA,AGA,EGA\">\\(AXA,EXA,AGA,EGA\\)</span>。派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nAFA=\\neg AG\\neg A,\\quad\nEFA=\\neg EG\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nAFA=\\neg AG\\neg A,\\quad\nEFA=\\neg EG\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(AXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(EXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AGA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(AGA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EGA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(EGA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(AXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(AXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(EXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(EXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(AGA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(AGA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(EGA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(EGA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{624}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{624}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{624}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{624}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{624}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{624}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{624}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{624}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{624}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(AXA)=AX\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(AXA)=AX\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(EXA)=EX\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(EXA)=EX\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(AGA)=AG\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(AGA)=AG\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(EGA)=EG\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(EGA)=EG\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,624}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,624}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}\\)</span>，定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分支时态公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXK}^{624}=\\{AX(A\\to B)\\to(AXA\\to AXB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXK}^{624}=\\{AX(A\\to B)\\to(AXA\\to AXB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{EXDual}^{624}=\\{EXA\\leftrightarrow\\neg AX\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{EXDual}^{624}=\\{EXA\\leftrightarrow\\neg AX\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AGFix}^{624}=\\{AGA\\to(A\\land AXAGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AGFix}^{624}=\\{AGA\\to(A\\land AXAGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{EGFix}^{624}=\\{EGA\\to(A\\land EXEGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{EGFix}^{624}=\\{EGA\\to(A\\land EXEGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{624}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXK}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EXDual}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AGFix}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EGFix}^{624}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{624}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{624}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXK}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EXDual}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AGFix}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EGFix}^{624}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}=\\{((A),AXA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}=\\{((A),AXA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land AXB)),B\\to AGA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land AXB)),B\\to AGA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land EXB)),B\\to EGA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land EXB)),B\\to EGA):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{624}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{624}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{624}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{624}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{624}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{624}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndAG}^{624}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{CoindEG}^{624}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{624}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{624}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{624}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{624}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当某证明中存在行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{624}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{624}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{624}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{624}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-分支时间语义\">9. 分支时间语义</h1>\n<p>分支时间模型为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Serial}_{624}(S,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq S\\times S\\land \\forall s\\in S\\ \\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Serial}_{624}(S,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq S\\times S\\land \\forall s\\in S\\ \\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(S\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Serial}_{624}(S,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Serial}_{624}(S,R)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span> 出发的路径是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:\\mathbb N\\to S\">\\(\\pi:\\mathbb N\\to S\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi(0)=s,\\quad \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\pi(n),\\pi(n+1))\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi(0)=s,\\quad \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\pi(n),\\pi(n+1))\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket AXA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\Rightarrow t\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket AXA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\Rightarrow t\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket EXA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\land t\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket EXA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\land t\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket AGA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall\\pi\\text{ 从 }s\\text{ 出发 }\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\pi(n)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket AGA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall\\pi\\text{ 从 }s\\text{ 出发 }\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\pi(n)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket EGA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists\\pi\\text{ 从 }s\\text{ 出发 }\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\pi(n)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket EGA\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists\\pi\\text{ 从 }s\\text{ 出发 }\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\pi(n)\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{624}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{624}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{624}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{624}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统把分支性写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AX,EX,AG,EG\">\\(AX,EX,AG,EG\\)</span> 四个状态公式构造子，并分别给出全分支与存在分支的不动点公理；第 9 节在串行分支时间结构上解释全路径与存在路径。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{BTM}_{624}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{624},\\operatorname{FV}_{624},\\operatorname{BV}_{624},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{624},\\operatorname{Sub}_{624},\\equiv_{\\alpha,624},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{624},\\mathsf{Rule}_{624},\\mathsf{Proof}_{624},\\vdash_{624},\\mathsf{Thm}_{624},\n\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{624},\\Vdash_{624},\\models_{624}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{BTM}_{624}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{624},\\operatorname{FV}_{624},\\operatorname{BV}_{624},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{624},\\operatorname{Sub}_{624},\\equiv_{\\alpha,624},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{624},\\mathsf{Rule}_{624},\\mathsf{Proof}_{624},\\vdash_{624},\\mathsf{Thm}_{624},\n\\mathsf{BTimeMod}_{624},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{624},\\Vdash_{624},\\models_{624}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由分支时态模态句法、公理、证明关系以及路径模型语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性或路径模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-分支时间语义","text":"9. 分支时间语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{AX},\\quad \\operatorname{EX},\\quad \\operatorname{AG},\\quad \\operatorname{EG}.","display":true},{"tex":"AXA,EXA,AGA,EGA","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nAFA=\\neg AG\\neg A,\\quad\nEFA=\\neg EG\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"AXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"EXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","display":false},{"tex":"AGA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{624}","disp